@@ -9313,3 +9313,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-18: PHASE D (ORACLE-DISTINCT cross-domain DETECTION; complementary; cheap; verifier_is_oracle=false) -- does the verifier-as-DETECTOR GENERALIZE beyond FoVer? exp4375/exp4381 measured detection on FoVer ONLY (AUROC 0.918). The verifier is DOMAIN-BOUND (north-star §0 step 2 'verifier domain expansion'; memory verifier-domain-bound-math-only: math strong, facts/code weak); the .404 SOTA-ingestion's own failure-mode note: 'Math PRM gains can FAIL on FoVer or ARC traces'. Score the detector against a NON-FoVer cached corpus (the GAP-4 ARC pool results/arc3_trm_verifier_rerank.json; and/or the cached code HumanEval/MBPP / GSM8K candidate pools from the headroom census per the detector spec). Report detection AUROC + the SELECTION-headroom PER domain -- the headline is the DIVERGENCE (detect where you cannot select). Emit detector_generalizes_cross_domain BARE bool := (detection AUROC CI95 lower bound > 0.5 on >=1 NON-FoVer domain). verifier_is_oracle=false. A win = the detection capability is a GENERAL Carnot property (not FoVer-specific) -- the verifier-domain-expansion step; a domain where detection ~= chance is LOGGED as a missing-verifier gap (ops/verifier_gaps.md) -- that IS the product backlog. This is cross-domain DETECTION (AUROC where selection headroom is ~0), NOT the RETIRED cross-domain SELECTION axis (exp4314). Cached candidates, CPU, zero quota. NO TRM training. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: detector_generalizes_cross_domain_non_fover; results/experiment_4386_cross_domain_detection_generalization.json
 - 2026-06-18: PHASE E1 (SOTA-ingestion; mandatory per SOTA-Ingestion Cycle Discipline) -- ingest the SOTA for the .405 bleeding-edge forks (verifier-as-detector step-error LOCALIZATION + selective-prediction / abstention; cross-domain detection generalization; ARC E3 executable-world-model deeper solves with lookahead-fidelity) and MAP the strongest 3-5 methods onto the .406 roadmap, conditioned on the .405 outcomes (did the detector become actionable -- localization genuine + abstention useful? did it COMPOUND? did it GENERALIZE cross-domain? did ARC reach deeper/tail levels?). Use the RELIABLE channel ONLY (scripts/sweep_clusters.py / sweep_semscholar.py + low-concurrency WebSearch/WebFetch) -- /deep-research is BANNED in-loop. Every method MUST carry a real, VERIFIED arXiv ID/URL (no citation = fabrication). FLAG A2D2 (2606.13565) + SEPO (2502.01384) verifier-as-reward GENERATOR-training as OUT-OF-BAND/operator-owned (NOT auto-run in-loop). Update research-studying.md (mark ingested) and emit flagged_for_v406 (the single strongest method for the .406 planner). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: sota_ingestion_v406_mapped; results/experiment_4387_sota_ingestion_v406.json
 - 2026-06-18: PHASE E2 (INFRA/HYGIENE) -- registry/gaps hygiene + GAP-4 regression guard. (1) Reconcile ops/verifier_registry.yaml + ops/verifier_gaps.md + ops/arc_solve_registry.yaml with the .405 outcomes (the actionable-detector result exp4381/4382; the detector-compounds result exp4385; the cross-domain detection generalization + any new chance-detection gaps exp4386; new ARC reproduced levels from exp4383-4384). (2) Run the GAP-4 regression guard (the ARC oracle-distinct verifier-beats-vote result must not silently regress). (3) Verify the capstone verifier_is_oracle stamping fix is STILL durable (the .402 exp4355 fix; confirm the .405 capstone path inherits it). NO production verifier edits (audit-only per Verifier Authenticity Discipline). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: registry_gaps_arc_reconciled_to_v405_truth_gap4_guard_passed_True_capstone_stamp_fix_durable_True; results/experiment_4388_registry_gaps_hygiene_gap4_guard.json
+- 2026-06-18: PHASE E3 (HARDWARE CONTINUITY; KV260 opportunistic per north-star §3) -- KV260 SSH-reachability + loaded-bitstream continuity check. Per north-star §3, KV260 is THE sovereignty story (drive to terminal, then freeze); GateMate/PolarFire are opportunistic-only. SSH-reachability precondition ONLY (NEVER a host SD-card precondition per KV260 SSH-Not-SD-Card Discipline). If the board is reachable, record the loaded overlay (xmutil listapps) + a lightweight liveness check (the carnot_ising bitstream UIO device present); if it is the terminal board-latency transcript, capture it. If unreachable -> honest_verdict blocked_kv260_ssh_unreachable (a clean documented skip, NOT a fabrication). This keeps the board visible in the milestone retro without burning a deep task slot. NO host SD-card-device precondition (the retired mechanism). NO TRM training. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success_kv260_continuity_terminal_reached; results/experiment_4389_hardware_continuity_kv260.json
